<description>&lt;p&gt;ISIL has continued to target Syrian security forces, killing two internal security members in a suicide attack in Hasakah and injuring several others, while another suicide bombing in Tartous wounded a security officer and killed a gunman. The Syrian government is considering a law to grant nationality to children of foreign fighters, reflecting concerns about the legacy of extremist participation. Qatar, Saudi Arabia and Jordan have issued condemnations of attacks on Syrian security facilities, indicating regional diplomatic responses. Syrian authorities seized Iranian weapons destined for Lebanon, showing ongoing arms interdiction efforts. 2,732 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE9zZWhzX3JnN0lod3RuWVhhSzZqRlZ5U2ttWEl2b0UtSzV0QVNjWGMzMVFsbzEtOTFYQjdxNG1EVmpvRVFRNDk1TlEtOEw0S0R4ZU1IMGZ0ck15MU55c1ZqakFvazFJdTlZSURpdmNUWnlwemFVY3BIMkpweXh3WnM?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxOeTd4b2lBcVEtUDcyRnYzMlFrSU1RRHgxY01ZX29QeVplRk14ZFdEWlJQdXVKUVY4emd1azNfdmJwR1dFVy1lcDd3eFJrbU01OE02eHhoaWJCckl0UnFZZUFwX2VyeWl6d2JQeHR3TkJFMnQtSm1zN20wbXJNdThDR1FIQWkzMUZyV2hJVUMtUVBtZ3h4OGlTNGNTNUFXeGtmemdPWlJfRHRfamt2MmpKb2JQdGprOUZ0ZlZGNjhyZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE9qNFJDNzM3SGpLeVgwcWNGOUUxTTZiN3pBUUZKMGtGamFHY3NpOURWVjd0WHJ5aHdsVUVaeWFsa0hBMGt0SHp6bw?oc=5&quot;&gt;سانا&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPM1FiaEVIazNRWTlUSHVjazJ6RVpxTm9PSTN5Q05zcm82cFM0enRBTnMxdkxXd3FTZjlzMFk2Y3M5N0JYVUhuNX